# Overview

AURA is a modular, voice-controlled personal AI assistant built around the ESP32 platform. The project combines embedded firmware, AI integration, web technologies, mobile development, and hardware prototyping into a single extensible system.

AURA V1 serves as the functional prototype and engineering validation platform for the future AURA V2 hardware.

